{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "strings": {
    "%1$@ の 設定 → Ethernet → IP を構成 → 手動 で、IP アドレスを %2$@、サブネットマスクを %3$@ にしてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the %1$@'s Settings → Ethernet → Configure IP → Manual, set the IP address to %2$@ and the subnet mask to %3$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@   %.1f MB   約%@点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@   %.1f MB   ~%@ points"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@  %.0fk点/s": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@  %.0fk pts/s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ の有線 LAN": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ wired LAN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@点  PCD保存できます": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ points · ready to save PCD"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@点%@   %.1f × %.1f × %.1f m   %@   %dms": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ points%@   %.1f × %.1f × %.1f m   %@   %d ms"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d:%02d   %@点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d:%02d   %@ points"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1本指: 回転   2本指: 移動   ピンチ: ズーム   ダブルタップ: 全体表示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 finger: rotate   2 fingers: pan   pinch: zoom   double tap: fit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1本指: 回転   2本指: 移動   ピンチ: ズーム   ダブルタップ: 追従": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 finger: rotate   2 fingers: pan   pinch: zoom   double tap: follow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ethernet 未接続": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Ethernet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ethernet待機中…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for Ethernet…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ethernet接続": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ethernet connected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IP アドレスと送信先": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IP Address and Destination"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IP アドレスの形式が正しくありません: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invalid IP address: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiDAR 受信なし": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No LiDAR data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiDAR 待機中（設定からデモを試せます）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for LiDAR (try the demo in Settings)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiDAR-IMU オドメトリは FAST-LIO（W. Xu, F. Zhang, RA-L 2021）の定式化に沿った独自実装です。Mid-360 との通信は公開されているプロトコルを独自に実装しており、Livox SDK は使っていません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The LiDAR-inertial odometry is an independent implementation following the FAST-LIO formulation (W. Xu, F. Zhang, RA-L 2021). Communication with the Mid-360 is an independent implementation of its published protocol and does not use the Livox SDK."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Livox Mid-360 を有線 LAN でつなぎ、その場で 3D マップの作成と自己位置推定を行います。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect a Livox Mid-360 over wired Ethernet to build 3D maps and localize on the spot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 からの応答を解釈できませんでした。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not understand the response from the Mid-360."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 から応答がありません。Mid-360 の IP が正しいか、%@ の IP が Mid-360 と同じサブネットにあるかを確認してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No response from the Mid-360. Check that its IP address is correct and that the %@'s IP is on the same subnet as the Mid-360."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 がなくても、部屋をスキャンしながら歩く様子を再現した疑似データで、ライブ表示・マップ作成・PCD保存・自己位置推定を試せます。オンの間は実機からのデータと混ざるので、実機を使うときはオフにしてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try live view, mapping, PCD saving and localization without a Mid-360, using simulated data of someone walking through a room. While this is on, it mixes with data from a real sensor, so turn it off when using real hardware."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 が設定を受け付けませんでした（ret_code 0x%02X, key 0x%04X）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Mid-360 rejected the settings (ret_code 0x%02X, key 0x%04X)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 と送信先に同じ IP は使えません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Mid-360 and the destination cannot use the same IP."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 に書き込む": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write to Mid-360"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 の IP を変えると、書き込み後に Mid-360 が再起動します（十数秒）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changing the Mid-360's IP restarts the Mid-360 after writing (takes 10–20 seconds)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 の IP アドレス": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mid-360 IP address"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 の IP アドレスや、点群の送り先（この %@ の IP）を確認・変更します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "View or change the Mid-360's IP address and where it sends its data (this %@'s IP)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 のネットワーク": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mid-360 Network"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 の設定を変更しますか？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change the Mid-360 settings?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360: %@ → %@\n送信先: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mid-360: %@ → %@\nDestination: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NDTマップを作れませんでした": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not build the NDT map"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PCD保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save PCD"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "■  停止": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "■  Stop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "▶  マップ作成 開始": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "▶  Start Mapping"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "▶  自己位置推定 開始": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "▶  Start Localization"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "● 記録": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "● Record"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いまの Mid-360 の IP です。点群を受信中なら自動で入ります。%@ の IP がこのアドレスと同じサブネットにないと設定できません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Mid-360's current IP. Filled in automatically while point data is coming in. The %@'s IP must be on the same subnet as this address to change settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このアプリについて": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About This App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このアプリについて・ライセンス": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About & Licenses"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このアプリは個人情報や利用状況を一切収集・送信しません。ローカルネットワークへのアクセスは、有線 LAN でつないだ LiDAR からデータを受信するためだけに使います。作成したマップや記録はこの %1$@ 内（ファイル App の「この%1$@内 › Mobile SLAM」）にだけ保存されます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This app does not collect or send any personal or usage data. Local network access is used only to receive data from a LiDAR connected over wired Ethernet. Maps and recordings are stored only on this %1$@ (Files app › On My %1$@ › Mobile SLAM)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まだ保存されたマップがありません。\nマップ作成後に「PCD保存」を押してください。\nPC などから受け取った PCD は「ファイルを開く」で取り込めます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No saved maps yet.\nAfter mapping, tap “Save PCD”.\nTo import a PCD from a computer or elsewhere, use “Open File”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "エラー": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キャンセル": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ゲートウェイ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gateway"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "サブネットマスク": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subnet mask"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ソケット作成失敗: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not open sockets: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "タップで表示・左にスワイプで削除\nファイル App の「この%@内 › Mobile SLAM」からも取り出せます": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap to view · swipe left to delete\nAlso available in Files › On My %@ › Mobile SLAM"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "タップで選択": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap to select"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "デモ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "デモ: 疑似 Mid-360 の点群を流しています": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demo: streaming simulated Mid-360 data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "デモ: 開始を押してください": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demo: tap Start"
          }
        }
