    },
    "反射強度：反射の弱い面は青、強い面は赤。\n高さ：点の高さで色を分けます。\n反射強度の入っていない PCD は高さで色を付けます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intensity: weakly reflecting surfaces are blue, strong ones red.\nHeight: points are coloured by height.\nPCD files without intensity are coloured by height."
          }
        }
      }
    },
