        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings are stored in the Mid-360 and kept when it is powered off. If you lose track of them, you can restore the factory settings (Mid-360: 192.168.1.1XX, destination: 192.168.1.50) with Livox Viewer 2 or similar tools."
